+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+To see the app's configuration values as JSON, use the
+:func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. ::
+
+    $ flask --app hello config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***"
+    }
+
+Any key containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY``
+(case-insensitive) is masked as ``"***"``, including keys in nested
+mappings and sequences. Values that are not JSON serializable are shown
+as strings.
+
+
